<title>YUGOSLAVIA: Yugoslav Oct '96 oil output rose to 89,000 tonnes.</title>
<headline>Yugoslav Oct '96 oil output rose to 89,000 tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>BELGRADE 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistical Office reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p>YUGOSLAV CRUDE OIL AND GAS EXTRACTION</p>
<p>					OCT 96     SEPT 96     OCT 95</p>
<p> crude petroleum (tonnes)     89,000	86,000     91,000</p>
<p> natural gas (mln cu.meters)	63	    53	   79</p>
<p>-- Amra Kevic, Belgrade newsroom +381 11 2224305</p>
</text>
